window.products.push({"id":90070,"name":"Reyhoar Dryer Vent Cover, Dryer Vent Seal, Out Door Opening Closure, Energy Saving Duct Cover, Stainless Steel, 4\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UZXMqAdKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have you encountered the trouble of poor material and poor sealing of the dryer vent cover? Do you need to change frequently? Then you had better try to buybuy a newly designed stainless steel dryer vent cover with backflow prevention. Why choose us? 1. Reduce unnecessary energy loss and keep the room warm. 2. Completely sealed design to prevent unwelcome things entering. 3. Made of newly upgraded stainless steel material, super durable. 4. The floating shuttle cup automatically open and close as required. 5. The installation is simple, it only takes 30 minutes to complete it. 6. Worry-free after-sales, full refund for any dissatisfaction within one year. 1.Package contains: 6 X Screws 1 X Dryer Vent 1 X Screwdriver 1 X Working Gloves 2.What size fit: Fits a 4-inch pipe diameter/vent opening. 3.How the vent works? When the dryer is working, hot air enters and passes through the elbow of hood, which pushs the floating shuttle cup upward and allows air to escape from the bottom of the hood. When the dryer is not working, the floating shuttle cup will automatically fall down and be closed to form a completely sealed state. This design can prevent cold wind and other unwelcome things from entering the house through the ventilation holes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UZXMqAdKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reyhoar","source_asin":"B08PKCY9JR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-90070","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PKCY9JR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PKCY9JR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
