window.products.push({"id":90164,"name":"MG Coffee Refillable Coffee Capsule,Reusable Holder Coffee Pod Compatible with Dolce Gusto Brewers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D8XB3j+RL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"COMPATIBILITY: These capsules work with Dolce Gusto include Mini Me,Circolo, Piccolo, Genio, Esperta Not COMPATIBILITY with Nespresso This is what you are looking for- MG Coffee Reusable Capsules - Money-saving: Reuse it more than 200 times - Eco-friendly: Could be usable and recycle - Durable: Premium plastic - Safe: 100% BPA free - Convenient: Use your favorite grind when you want. It hardly takes up any storage space and even cannot feel its weight, easy to carry and storage. Specification - Size: 54mm*35mm- Compatibility: Fits all Dolce Gusto Models Including the Mini Me, Piccolo, Genio, Esperta and Circolo- NOT Compatible with Nespresso Machine. Have an eye on how put the capsule in the holder -The Hole Has To Be Align With The Puncturing Needle In The Machine, i mean, the hole has to be toward you Few things to be aware using it: 1) When using 1st time try to find the point where needle goes in to the capsule. DO NOT FORCE CLOSEThan just mark the point (position) with white marker for future use 2) Be careful - sometimes you might dispose the bottom mesh with the coffee - ALWAYS CHECK3) Make sure the capsule is closed tightly the capsule Tips: 1) If by mistake happens to make an extra hole (with the needle) on the cup just cover with scotch tape and you can still use the capsule 2) Use Espresso grind for best results with cream. Tried different amounts of coffee in the pod to brew you favorite taste, but do not exceed 3/4 cup3)The reusable capsule fits tightly, sometimes maybe too tight, in fact is kind of difficult to take it out, the best way is pushing the bottom part with your finger and it will pop out, but careful it could be still hot.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D8XB3j+RL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MG Coffee","source_asin":"B073S3SCVB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-90164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073S3SCVB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B073S3SCVB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
