window.products.push({"id":90229,"name":"PROKITCHEN BBQ Grill Mat - Set of 5 Non Stick BBQ Grilling Mats with Tongs - Essential Grilling Accessories and BBQ Tools","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mGS2NaOoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Having a barbecue is the perfect way to hang out with friends and cook flavorful food, fast. But nothing takes the fun out of grilling more than opening the cover and finding a messy grill caked with barbecues past!NOT ANYMORE! Now you can keep your grill clean and ready at all times. Not only that, our grill mat means you can infuse a wider range of dishes with that deliciously smoky flavor, with grill marks, effortlessly. Seriously, you’ll wonder how you ever grilled without them. Features 1.MULTIPURPOSE - Our flexible grill mats work with any kind of barbecue grill - Weber, Charbroil, Big Green Egg, smoker, charcoal, propane, gas, or electric. Better than any grill pan or basket, they can be cut to fit any size grill, flat tops and sandwich grills too! Also doubles as a bake mat!2.You can throw almost everything on the cooking grates; Perfect for chicken, wings, ribs, burgers, steaks, fish, fruits, vegetables, eggs, seafood, and even pizza!3.Easy clean surface; Just allow the grill mat to cool, wipe the double-sided mat clean with warm,soapy water,and it won't hold onto any food odors.4.No more dirty grill,No more dirty food! For camping,campgrounds,patio grill and for indoor baking.5. Heat resistant up to 500 degrees. Package include 5 set 16\"x13\" Grill Mats A set of 12\" Food Tong AFTER-SALES SERVICE If you have any dissatisfaction with the goods, you can contact us, we can meet you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mGS2NaOoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PROKITCHEN","source_asin":"B01MSRCIX6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-90229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MSRCIX6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MSRCIX6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
