window.products.push({"id":90263,"name":"Non-stick Coating Stainless Steel Milk Frothing Pitcher, 5oz/150ml Milk Coffee Cappuccino Latte Art Frothing Pitcher Barista Jug Froth Espresso Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iqtvHbFQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Milk Frothing Pitcher give you the professional edge so you can enjoy perfectly steamed or frothed milk any time you want it. Start your day with a heavenly macchiato. Treat the kids with creamy hot cocoa. Impress friends with fancy latte art. Or just elevate your everyday with a dreamy cappuccino on a rainy evening--all in the comfort of home. Why Choose our Milk Pitcher? Best Experience: One of the hardest parts of creating cafe quality drinks at home is getting the foam or steamed milk just right. Scalded milk and limp foam do not start your day off right. Thankfully, this Milk Frothing Pitcher gives you a professional edge. Best Function: This premium milk frothing pitcher quickly creates rich froth for all your favorites such as cappuccinos and lattes.Our frothing mug is easy to create coffee drinks exactly the way you like them at the perfect temperature and with delicious foam. Best for Gift: Wonderful Holiday gift for family and friends.Use it alongside your countertop espresso machine to indulge in your favorite drinks without paying premium prices, looking for parking or waiting in lines.Starting today, thanks to the Frothing Pitcher you can enjoy the most amazing espressos, cappuccinos, caramel macchiatos, and even hot cocoa for your children! Specifications: Material: Stainless Steel  Size: L80*W80*H95mm Capacity: 12oz/350ml Color: Chrome Surface: Mirror Finish Package: 1 x Stainless Steel Milk Frothing Pitcher  1 x Decorating Art Pen 1 x Microfiber Cloth（blue）  LIFETIME GUARANTEE & FRIENDLY CUSTOMER SERVICE - We have a commitment to every buyer １００％ satisfaction.If you have any problem about our pitcher, just contact us anytime. Great Value for Money - Click the ADD TO CART button now and order yours now!!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iqtvHbFQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wolltoll","source_asin":"B08XK6C6ZD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-90263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XK6C6ZD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XK6C6ZD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":90264,"name":"Joy Pebble Portable Ice Makers Countertop,26 lbs in 24H,9 pcs in 6-8min,2 Ice Sizes(S/L),Portable Ice Maker with Ice Scoop&Basket for Home/Office/Bar ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":114.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HpIvjVioL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"6 MINS 9 CUBES READY-TO-SERVE -Joy Pebble portable ice maker machine works quickly, just 6 minutes to get 9pcs of bullet-shaped ice cubes per cycle. Up to 26 lbs/12 kg of ice in 24 hrs with its 2-liter/68 oz water tank. [Note] Since the ice machine needs time to preheat like refrigerator, it will produce faster and stabilize to 6-8 Mins per cycle after a few more cycles. Before first use, find a sport for the machine and set it upright and leave it alone for an hour to function well. INTELLIGENT ICE MAKER WITH SMART INDICTOR - With simple control panel, just add water, plug it in, press the power button, select the ice size and forget it. The indicator lights up when the ice is full or you need more water. No plumbing required, easy to fill and clean. With a outlet and drain plug at the bottom, easy to empty the unused water. Don't need any complex installation. SUPER QUIET & ENERGY EFFICIENT - Joy Pebble portable ice making machines achieves low noise level, fast cooling effect and low consumption with a powerful compressor, high quality copper aluminum fin condenser. It runs at less than 45dB (like whisper), quieter than other ice cube makers in market, which means your entertainment & sleep will not be disturbed. Easy to fill and clean. With a outlet and drain plug at the bottom, easy to empty the unused water. SMALL OR LARGE ICE + BASKET & ICE SCOOP - Joy Pebble portable ice maker offers two sizes of ice bullets. The small ice bullets are easily fit in narrow water bottles while large ice bullets chill faster, melt slower, and are perfect for mixed drinks, iced food, and more. If you are a big fan of chewing ice, ice bullets are perfect as it's hollow and won't hurt your mouth. The ice bucket is removable, so if you need a large amount of ice, just simply take the bucket to wherever you like. SAFE & DURABLE ICE MAKER MACHINE - Made of food-grade material, just for your health and safety. Durable shell, smooth and easy to clean. Large translucent window for easy observation. BONUS-removable ice basket and ice scoop, convenient for you to transfer the ice cubes to your drink or ice bucket. 1-YEARS MANUFACTURER'S WARRANTY -- Shop with confidence. Any question about Joy Pebble portable ice maker, pls contact with customer Service directly, we will reply to your email within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HpIvjVioL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joy Pebble","source_asin":"B0C3Q5VZY6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-90264","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3Q5VZY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3Q5VZY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
