window.products.push({"id":90282,"name":"Adq56656401 Dryer Lint Filters replacement for LG kenmore Dryer by Beauicy - 2023 UPGRADED STAINLESS STEEL mesh screen - Replaces Adq566564, 796814722","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pnz93aGFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【ADQ56656401 LINT FILTERS】Dryer lint screen adq56656401 traps lint & debris from the exhaust air flowing from the dryer, Approx. 12\" wide x 11\" high and compatible with LG, Kenmore/Sears Dryers. Dryer lint filter replacement parts is used to filter debris and lint in the dryer. Our filter mesh surface is made of high quality stainless steel. The frame is made of ABS, the overall structure is firm and durable. ✅【FITS MODELS】:This LG Kenmore adq56656401 dryer traps lint screen part numbers: ADQ566564, AP4457244, 1462822, AH3531962, EA3531962, PS3531962, etc. Perfect for LG/kenmore dryers:DLE3500W/00, DLE3600V/00, DLEX3360V, DLEX3370V, DLEX3370W, DLEX3700W/00, DLE3170W, DLEX3001R, DLEX357000V DLEX390000000W, DLEXW, DLEX357 DLGX347 1W, DLGX4271W, DLGX3361R, DLGX3361V, DLGX3361W, DLGX3371V, DLGX3371W, 79680512900, 79680518900 and 79681022900, DLGX3002R, DLEX34 70W,DLEX3370R etc. ✅【PACKAGE INCLUDES & SYMPTOMS】:Includes 1 x ADQ56656401 Dryer Lint Screen Filter. ADQ56656401 lint filter assembly, made of ABS frame construction and stainless steel metal screen, and rigorously tested by the manufacturer. If the lint filter pops up, catches on the clothes, or doesn't fit in the case correctly.The dryer filter guide and cover guide should be replaced. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】:The product ADQ56656401 Dryer Lint Filter supports 365 Days return and exchange.Lint screen ADQ56656401 traps lint and debris from the exhaust air flowing from the dryer.This helps increase airflow to maximize drying efficiency and reduce drying time. When the lint filter is damaged or missing, a large amount of lint can collect in the dryer exhaust hose. Not only can this cause a fire, but it can also reduce the efficiency and lifespan of the dryer. Do not operate the dryer without a lint filter. ✅【DIFFERENT From 5231EL1003B filter】: Shape of the ADQ56656401 filter is similar to the 5231EL1003B filter. Please confirm the size you need. The ADQ56656401 filter does not have a gasket and is smaller than the 5231EL1003B filter.And the ADQ56656401 lint filter features 4 nubs, but the 5231EL1003B filter features 3 nubs. If you select the wrong filter, it will not be suitable for your dryer.★Please confirm carefully the lint filter you need before ordering!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pnz93aGFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B083NFJMFW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-90282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083NFJMFW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083NFJMFW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
