window.products.push({"id":90324,"name":"YOLENY Electric Portable Compact Laundry Dryer 1.6 cu.ft, 9 lbs Load Stainless Steel Portable Dryer, 4 Drying Mode, Cold Air Care, for Apartments, Whi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AwT7J0KKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👚【FAST DRYING】-This powerful and conveniently designed portable dryer weighs only 37.5 pounds, yet has the ability to dry up to 9 pounds of laundry at once. It operates at 155°F to ensure your clothes dry quickly, even in rainy and cold weather. *Spin dry required before drying. 👖【4 DRYING MODES & COLD AIR CARE FUNCTION】-You can turn the knob to choose different working hours and working modes according to the material and weight of the clothes. From cold air care, which removes odors from your clothes, to drying large items, this dryer machine has a variety of drying modes for you to choose from. 👗【MULTIPLE FILTRATION & REMOVABLE FILTER PADS】- Multiple filtration system can ensure that the clothes are dried in a hygienic environment. While drying, this clothes dryer can also remove some of the original dust and hair on the clothes. The detachable design and the matching 5 filter pads provided allow the product to be used for a longer period of time. *Clean the filter pad immediately after use. 👔【ENERGY SAVING & SILENT OPERATION】- With only 830W of power, it is very energy efficient. And you can use it while reading, studying, working, or sleeping. The quiet design allows you to use our portable clothes dryer even late at night without noise disturbance. Low noise: 58-62dB. 👙【SPACE SAVING】 - The petite size of 20\" x 16\" x 24\" (L x W x H) allows you to put it in any corner or even stack it on the washing machine, which greatly saves space. And the power cord is 73'' long, so it is not bound by the power supply location. This mini dryer is suitable for all apartment and dormitory dwellers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AwT7J0KKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOLENY","source_asin":"B09CYNPGHK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-90324","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CYNPGHK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CYNPGHK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
