window.products.push({"id":90432,"name":"WILLHI WLH8040 Digital Humidity Controller Switch Hygrometer for Mushroom Greenhouse Home Brewing Planting Reptile Humidifier Dehumidifier","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eBoB6i1tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a digital humidity controller with wide humidity measuring and control range. There's 1 relays on this controller. Humidification and Dehumidification modes can be set through the menu. Dehumidification Mode Example: If you want a dehumidifiers to be turned on at 95% and turned off at 85%. Set the controller to Dehumidification mode, set target humidity to 85 and set differential value(humidity span) to 10. Once detected humidity is above 95%, the controller turns on dehumidifiers. Once detected humidity reaches 85%, the controller turns off dehumidifiers Humidification Mode Example: If you want a humidifiers to be turned on at 60% and turned off at 80%. Set the controller to Humidification mode, set target humidity to 80 and set differential value(humidity span) to 20. Once detected humidity is below 60%, the controller turns on your humidifiers. Once detected humidity reaches 80%, the controller turns off the humidifiers Specifications: Humidity Measuring Range: 1% ~ 100% RH Humidity control Range: 1% ~ 99% RH Differential value range is 1% - 25% (Humidity span between power ON and power OFF of your humidifiers/dehumidifiers) Control resolution: 1%(minimum humidity span between power ON and power OFF) Humidity Measuring accuracy: 3% Temperature sensor Cable length: 1m / 3.3ft Data retention: YES Power Suppler of this Controller: AC 110V, 50/60Hz Power consumption: <3W Relay contact capability:10A/110V Working temperature: -4°F ~140°F Size: Front panel size: 75(L) x 34.5(W)(mm) Mounting size:71(L) x 29(mm) Product size:75(L) x 34.5(W) x 85(D)(mm) Humidity sensor cable length: 1m / 3.3ft Package Include: 1 x AC 110V Humidity controller w/ sensor 1 x English Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eBoB6i1tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WILLHI","source_asin":"B08CDCBSQL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-90432","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CDCBSQL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CDCBSQL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
