window.products.push({"id":90585,"name":"Corelle Coordinates Summer Blush Economy Burner Covers, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FA0D66EPL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Blushing pansies sing with joy as a variety of your favorite pastels colors come to life. Pattern is placed on a economy burner cover set. Amazon.com Brighten up that kitchen the blossoming pansies and pastels colors on this set of burner covers in Corelle's Summer Blush pattern. A floral garland of pansies with pale green and beige leaves decorates the outside edge and reflects light that emanates from the white body for a subtle vibrancy. The two pairs of small and large covers are chip-resistant for optimal durability, and should be washed by hand. As with all Corelle products, this set is completely backed by a one-year warranty. For a unified kitchen theme, tie in these burner covers with possibilities from an array of matching pieces from the extensive Summer Blush pattern, such as, a teapot, crock-pot, kettle, salt- and peppershakers, sugar bowl, and more! Corelle's Summer Blush is a versatile pattern that works with a wide range of colors and styles, and is part of the Corelle Coordinates collection. Corelle Coordinates dinnerware is extremely versatile, and can transfer directly from refrigerator or freezer to microwave, convection oven, or preheated conventional oven. Corelle Dinnerware's unique lamination process--compressing two different glass compositions--results in a product that is far stronger than any other dinnerware. And, with their ergonomic, lightweight design, Corelle plates and bowls stack easily to conserve valuable kitchen space. Corelle products come in an array of fashionable patterns and coordinates, including country, contemporary and traditional styles. --Brian Olson","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FA0D66EPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reston Lloyd","source_asin":"B0007L9J6S","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-90585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007L9J6S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007L9J6S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
