window.products.push({"id":90597,"name":"Brama Outdoor Refrigerator Built-In or Freestanding with Automatic Defrost, LED Display and Control Panel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1200.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x2S1PZyTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed for outdoor use, this Brama Outdoor Mini Refrigerator offers both built-in and freestanding installation option due to its front exhaust and compact size. With a temperature-controlled interior and a cooling range of 34°-43°F, it ensures your favorite beverages are always perfectly chilled, allowing you to enjoy refreshing drinks even on hot summer days. Safely store up to 161 cans of your preferred beverages, keeping them conveniently accessible whenever you need a cool refreshment. The reversible door and leveling legs provide flexible placement options, adapting to your space and setup requirements. Three adjustable glass shelves offer customizable storage, accommodating items of different sizes and shapes. The automatic defrost function takes care of maintenance, eliminating the need for manual defrosting and ensuring hassle-free operation. The interior LED light illuminates the contents, allowing you to easily locate your desired items even in low-light conditions. With an efficient Embraco compressor at its core, this refrigerator delivers reliable performance while maintaining energy efficiency. The durable 304 stainless steel exterior and pole handle provide enhanced durability, preventing rust and ensuring the unit withstands outdoor conditions for years to come. Setting the perfect temperature is effortless with the user-friendly digital control panel, allowing you to adjust the settings with ease. The refrigerator maintains consistent temperature levels, ensuring the safety and freshness of your perishables, even in outdoor environments with temperatures ranging from 44°F-106°F. This Brama Outdoor Refrigerator is ETL listed for both residential and commercial use, meeting the highest safety and quality standards. It also complies with CEC standards, ensuring energy efficiency and environmental responsibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x2S1PZyTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BRAMA","source_asin":"B0C7SH9LXQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-90597","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7SH9LXQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7SH9LXQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
