window.products.push({"id":90910,"name":"ICEPURE ADQ747935 Refrigerator Water Filter and Air Filter Replacement for LG ® LT1000P®,MDJ64844601, Kenmore Elite 9980, ADQ74793501 LT1000PC ® ADQ74","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IaCqAFWlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️【Authoritative Certifications】：NSF/ANSI 42 & 372 Lead-Free from IAPMO, European Food Grade Regulations EC-1935/2016, ROHS, REACH, BPA-Free, TUV, and Australian Water Mark. ICEPURE RWF4700AB replacement for LG LT1000P refrigerator water filter was produced under quality systems ISO9001/ ISO14000. And under the supervision of the three major American authorities: IAPMO, NSF, and WQA. Pure water, Better Life. For higher filtering levels (NSF/ANSI 401 certified), please search for ASIN: B09MF4RRYZ ❄️【Excellent Filtration Effect】：The filtering effect of ICEPURE RWF4700AB refrigerator water filter replacement for LG ADQ747935 and Kenmore Elite 9980 is extremely well, which can remove many kinds of harmful impurities in the water. Laboratory test data show that it can remove 99.5% Chlorine, Bad Taste, Organic Compounds, Odor, Rust, THM, VOCs, and other solid particles. Significantly improving the taste of drinking water to provide pure-tasting water to our family! ❄️【100% Match & Easy to install】：ICEPURE water filters using advanced fully automated industrial technology, The measurement technology is accurate to microns. Withstood thousands of water hammer tests to ensure that our products perfectly match the original products and no worry about leaking. Detailed installation steps and the most common installation troubleshooting methods are written in the manual. If you having trouble when installing it, please feel free to contact us! ❄️【Premium Filter Materials】:Top coconut shell activated carbon Certified by NSF. Unlike some low-end filtration products that use coal-based or apricot shell-activated carbon, All the products of ICEPURE filter material are selected high-quality coconut shell-activated carbon, which has a larger specific surface area, more micropores, and more clean. The Outer layer is 0.5 microns, ensuring better filtration of harmful impurities in water. Lead-Free. BPA-Free, Food grade material. ❄️【Replacement for Models】: LG-LT1000P, 1000P, LT1000PCS, LT-1000PC, LT1000P/PC/PCS, Kenmore 46-9980, 46 9980, 469980, LFXC22526S, LFXC22526D, LFXC22596S, LFXC24796, LFXC24796D, LFXC24796S, LFXC24796D/00, LFXS26596S, LFXS26973S, LFXS26973S/01, LFXS28566S, LFXS28566D, LFXS28968S, LFXS28968D, LFXS30796, LFXS30796D, LFXS30796S, LMXC23796, LMXC23796D, LMXS28626D, LMXS28636S, LMXS30796, LMXS30796D, LMXS30796D/00, LMXS30796S, LSFXC2496D, LSXC22396, LSXC22396S, LSXC22396D, LSXS26396. ❄️【Fits Models】:ICEPURE RWF4700AB RWF4700A-S, GOLDEN ICEPURE, AQUACREST AQF-LT1000P, Water drop WD-LT1000P, GLACIER FRESH GF-1000P, OEM Pureza filters PF15, PF16, Crystala CF16, FilterLogic FL-RF46, Waterspecialist WS646A, MB-LT1000P, BELVITA BL003-S,Tier1 RWF1053, Mist CWMF002, Zuma ZWFL7-RF300, Colpure CLT-2, PurePlus PP-LT1000P, OH OH-1000p, Aqua Blue AB-9834, MR15, Tahoe LT1000P, FilterOne LT1000P fridge cartridge. Air Filter: ADQ73214404, ADQ73334008, 46-9918, 469918, 9918. ❄️【Great Value for Money】: It is a great way to have a healthy and clean source of drinking water but can not worry about your budget. From now on, you won’t need to spend money on bottled water. Stay away from the invasion of plastic particles on our bodies and save money at the same time! LT120F air filters in the package can effectively remove the peculiar smell of the refrigerator and make the food fresher! ❄️【 Long Serve Life】: ICEPURE refrigerator water filter’s ability to remove Chlorine after testing 200 Gallons of water in the laboratory is still 90%. But in order to ensure that we can always drink clean and fresh water, we highly recommend replacing it every 6 months or 200 gallons of water filtered. Note: It also depends on the water quality and the amount of water being filtered. ❄️【Free Monthly Stickers】: Apply the month sticker to the new cartridge and mark your calendar to remind you to replace the filter after six months. ICEPURE is committed to providing you with a full range of caring services! ❄️【Quality Assurance】: ICEPURE is an American company. Our factory has been producing high-quality filtration products for 20+ years. A number of products have obtained the authority certification issued by WQA, NSF401, NSF473, NSF58, NSF53, NSF42, and NSF372 certification. 24 hours/7 days customer service, ICEPURE is committed to providing high-quality after-sales protection!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IaCqAFWlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICEPURE","source_asin":"B0BLGTGQMW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-90910","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLGTGQMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLGTGQMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
